(1906617, 263098, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but there is something about the composition I don''t like. Maybe it''s the way the white space is a bit unbalanced, or the way the tops of the cameras on the top row are cut off? You''ve blown the highlights a little as well. Still, awesome collection, and all things considered, quite a good photograph of it.</td>', 'I like your idea, but there is something about the composition I don''t like. Maybe it''s the way the white space is a bit unbalanced, or the way the tops of the cameras on the top row are cut off? You''ve blown the highlights a little as well. Still, awesome collection, and all things considered, quite a good photograph of it.', '2005-11-30 02:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906623, 263000, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like this. It doesn''t overwhelmingly say COLLECTION to me, but I''m scoring it high for originality. I like the narrow DOF.</td>', 'I like this. It doesn''t overwhelmingly say COLLECTION to me, but I''m scoring it high for originality. I like the narrow DOF.', '2005-11-30 02:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906624, 263140, 48524, '<td valign="top">It''s so blurry...</td>', 'It''s so blurry...', '2005-11-30 02:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906628, 263460, 47487, '<td valign="top">I love Saint-Exupery.</td>', 'I love Saint-Exupery.', '2005-11-30 02:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906629, 261411, 48524, '<td valign="top">That one shadow in the middle is very distracting, but overall I kind of like it.  In a somewhat morbid way.</td>', 'That one shadow in the middle is very distracting, but overall I kind of like it.  In a somewhat morbid way.', '2005-11-30 02:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906632, 261257, 48524, '<td valign="top">Having trouble seeing how this relates to collections.</td>', 'Having trouble seeing how this relates to collections.', '2005-11-30 02:43:59.000000', NULL, 1);
