(1906638, 262523, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like. The titled one at the top is a good idea, adds a lot of interest.</td>', 'Oh, I like. The titled one at the top is a good idea, adds a lot of interest.', '2005-11-30 02:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906641, 263150, 48524, '<td valign="top">Nice idea :)</td>', 'Nice idea :)', '2005-11-30 02:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906642, 263155, 47487, '<td valign="top">Those are cute, and I like the surface you''ve set them on.</td>', 'Those are cute, and I like the surface you''ve set them on.', '2005-11-30 02:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906646, 263770, 48524, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a little on the small side, though, and if there was slightly more focus on the center pony staring out...</td>', 'Nice shot, a little on the small side, though, and if there was slightly more focus on the center pony staring out...', '2005-11-30 02:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906650, 263630, 47487, '<td valign="top">Great set-up on this.</td>', 'Great set-up on this.', '2005-11-30 02:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906655, 263552, 47487, '<td valign="top">Wow. I like this.</td>', 'Wow. I like this.', '2005-11-30 02:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906656, 263459, 47487, '<td valign="top">Adorable subject -- my daughter will squeal with glee when I show her this -- but it looks like you had a little bit of camera shake. If you have a tripod, you might try that next time.</td>', 'Adorable subject -- my daughter will squeal with glee when I show her this -- but it looks like you had a little bit of camera shake. If you have a tripod, you might try that next time.', '2005-11-30 03:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906660, 262814, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is gorgeous. So emotive as well.</td>', 'Oh, this is gorgeous. So emotive as well.', '2005-11-30 03:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906661, 262828, 41183, '<td valign="top">nice one cool pic</td>', 'nice one cool pic', '2005-11-30 03:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906665, 261411, 47487, '<td valign="top">That is fascinating. Is that the shadow of your camera on the fourth row up? Maybe you could have positioned it so the shadow fell in a gap... still, wow. Interesting to look at.</td>', 'That is fascinating. Is that the shadow of your camera on the fourth row up? Maybe you could have positioned it so the shadow fell in a gap... still, wow. Interesting to look at.', '2005-11-30 03:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906668, 261358, 47487, '<td valign="top">The way you have them posed, they look very expressive. Like they''re both looking at the same thing and have different reactions to it. I don''t know if you did it intentionally but I like it; it gives them distinct personalities.  Good lighting also.</td>', 'The way you have them posed, they look very expressive. Like they''re both looking at the same thing and have different reactions to it. I don''t know if you did it intentionally but I like it; it gives them distinct personalities.  Good lighting also.', '2005-11-30 03:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906679, 263723, 47487, '<td valign="top">&amp; well-composed. :)</td>', '& well-composed. :)', '2005-11-30 03:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906688, 261753, 47377, '<td valign="top">would have been better without the distractions in the background 5</td>', 'would have been better without the distractions in the background 5', '2005-11-30 03:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906690, 262967, 47377, '<td valign="top">rather bland lighting... maybe darken the room and use a torch?</td>', 'rather bland lighting... maybe darken the room and use a torch?', '2005-11-30 03:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906691, 263279, 47377, '<td valign="top">I like the objects. some of the patterns in the stone are wonderful but the composition lets this picture down...</td>', 'I like the objects. some of the patterns in the stone are wonderful but the composition lets this picture down...', '2005-11-30 03:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906718, 261411, 47377, '<td valign="top">The shaddow in the middle ruins this picture for me... without it I would have given it an 8... now 5</td>', 'The shaddow in the middle ruins this picture for me... without it I would have given it an 8... now 5', '2005-11-30 03:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906720, 263643, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF!!</td>', 'Nice DOF!!', '2005-11-30 03:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906723, 263459, 42601, '<td valign="top">Bad focus...</td>', 'Bad focus...', '2005-11-30 03:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906727, 263396, 42601, '<td valign="top">QUite funny, and your comp seems fine...<br/> <br/>It''s just a bit "dull" for me. I think the lighting is too strong.<br/> <br/>Maybe if you just used a desk lamp and left the shutter open, it couldve created a more... pokerish feel?</td>', 'QUite funny, and your comp seems fine... It''s just a bit "dull" for me. I think the lighting is too strong. Maybe if you just used a desk lamp and left the shutter open, it couldve created a more... pokerish feel?', '2005-11-30 04:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906750, 262303, 29906, '<td valign="top">I am not getting how this fits the challenge, but the shot is just incredible. 10+</td>', 'I am not getting how this fits the challenge, but the shot is just incredible. 10+', '2005-11-30 04:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906768, 263065, 40623, '<td valign="top">nicely scattered... i like it</td>', 'nicely scattered... i like it', '2005-11-30 05:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906777, 262490, 48074, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting and different interpretation of collection ! very nice</td>', 'That''s an interesting and different interpretation of collection ! very nice', '2005-11-30 05:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906784, 261743, 8140, '<td valign="top">what''s rare on this photo that makes your collection special. also I does not like composition and color cast. Even if I do not know you I think you can do it better 2</td>', 'what''s rare on this photo that makes your collection special. also I does not like composition and color cast. Even if I do not know you I think you can do it better 2', '2005-11-30 05:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906785, 263713, 8140, '<td valign="top">I like composition and idea. only IMHO right side of the photo is a little bit overexposed. 5</td>', 'I like composition and idea. only IMHO right side of the photo is a little bit overexposed. 5', '2005-11-30 05:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906787, 261440, 8140, '<td valign="top">a little bit out of focus. IMO better depth of field would be better, nice composition and colors 7</td>', 'a little bit out of focus. IMO better depth of field would be better, nice composition and colors 7', '2005-11-30 05:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906791, 263456, 8140, '<td valign="top">too much bllury photo. you should be using tripod for this. colors are OK, but texas looks like overexposed</td>', 'too much bllury photo. you should be using tripod for this. colors are OK, but texas looks like overexposed', '2005-11-30 05:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906793, 263649, 8140, '<td valign="top">cool idea and good angle. I only does not like that reflection on the left side.</td>', 'cool idea and good angle. I only does not like that reflection on the left side.', '2005-11-30 05:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906797, 263339, 8140, '<td valign="top">i like angle, and DOF. maybe lighter would be better but ...</td>', 'i like angle, and DOF. maybe lighter would be better but ...', '2005-11-30 05:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906800, 262570, 8140, '<td valign="top">too much reflections IMO. maybe you could try light tent with white cotton to difuse light softly onto glossy objects</td>', 'too much reflections IMO. maybe you could try light tent with white cotton to difuse light softly onto glossy objects', '2005-11-30 05:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906815, 262647, 45857, '<td valign="top">These are great!  They almost look real.<br/>Selective desat works well here.</td>', 'These are great!  They almost look real.Selective desat works well here.', '2005-11-30 05:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906817, 263512, 40623, '<td valign="top">that''s a lot...</td>', 'that''s a lot...', '2005-11-30 05:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906819, 261411, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the potential.  Criticism; that shadow on the skull in the second row is too distracting and detracts too much from this image.  A different crop, perhaps even a sharper angle (side on), and possibly more symmetry, would have made this a much better shot in my opinion.  Not sure on the toning, works, but either needs some ''tweaking'' or else maybe color, or another ''toning'' would have been better, not sure.</td>', '6 - Like the potential.  Criticism; that shadow on the skull in the second row is too distracting and detracts too much from this image.  A different crop, perhaps even a sharper angle (side on), and possibly more symmetry, would have made this a much better shot in my opinion.  Not sure on the toning, works, but either needs some ''tweaking'' or else maybe color, or another ''toning'' would have been better, not sure.', '2005-11-30 05:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906824, 263239, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice effect and toning.  Criticism; not sure on the cars at the fore, they don''t flow/fit in with the feel (especially the fore one), in my opinion.  Perhaps a different placement of them, not sure, also maybe a little more space on one of the sides, may have also made this better.  Can''t discern what that is on the horse''s ''cheek'', reflection perhaps, either way, unusual effect.</td>', '7 - Nice effect and toning.  Criticism; not sure on the cars at the fore, they don''t flow/fit in with the feel (especially the fore one), in my opinion.  Perhaps a different placement of them, not sure, also maybe a little more space on one of the sides, may have also made this better.  Can''t discern what that is on the horse''s ''cheek'', reflection perhaps, either way, unusual effect.', '2005-11-30 06:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906825, 262335, 38725, '<td valign="top">Lovely model but I''m not keen on the grain and the background is a bit distracting. Interesting angle though.</td>', 'Lovely model but I''m not keen on the grain and the background is a bit distracting. Interesting angle though.', '2005-11-30 06:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906826, 262303, 46116, '<td valign="top">superb picture, but "collection"?</td>', 'superb picture, but "collection"?', '2005-11-30 06:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906828, 263748, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Can''t see Putin.  Like the potential here.  Criticism; perhaps a tighter crop, especially at the fore/bottom and a light reflection ''adjustment'' may have made this better in my opinion.  Possibly also some ''unusual'' lighting to try to give a more ''dramatic'' effect, or some ''depth'' to this.</td>', '5 - Can''t see Putin.  Like the potential here.  Criticism; perhaps a tighter crop, especially at the fore/bottom and a light reflection ''adjustment'' may have made this better in my opinion.  Possibly also some ''unusual'' lighting to try to give a more ''dramatic'' effect, or some ''depth'' to this.', '2005-11-30 06:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906830, 263119, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Criticism; there was/is the potential to be much more creative here in my opinion.  The lighting, focal points, angle, background, etc - even ''staging'' the characters here, could have made this much more ''interesting'' and added a bit of ''depth''.</td>', '3 - Criticism; there was/is the potential to be much more creative here in my opinion.  The lighting, focal points, angle, background, etc - even ''staging'' the characters here, could have made this much more ''interesting'' and added a bit of ''depth''.', '2005-11-30 06:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906831, 262344, 8140, '<td valign="top">this should be applied to Industrial challenge not Collections</td>', 'this should be applied to Industrial challenge not Collections', '2005-11-30 06:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906836, 263652, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good colors.  Criticism; in my opinion this is more about the child than the cars/collection.  If the focus were on them, and the child out of focus, would have made this better for the Challenge in my opinion.  Like the angle, even sharper would possibly also make this better. edit:typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 08:00:08.</i></td>', '5 - Good colors.  Criticism; in my opinion this is more about the child than the cars/collection.  If the focus were on them, and the child out of focus, would have made this better for the Challenge in my opinion.  Like the angle, even sharper would possibly also make this better. edit:typos', '2005-11-30 06:29:51.000000', '2005-12-07 08:00:08.000000', 1),
(1906839, 263737, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like the potential.  Criticism; more attention to the composition/placements and also cropping, if possible would have made this better in my opinion.  Too much seems either out of focus or blurry.  Not sure on the toning, works, but perhaps needs some tweaking.</td>', '3 - Like the potential.  Criticism; more attention to the composition/placements and also cropping, if possible would have made this better in my opinion.  Too much seems either out of focus or blurry.  Not sure on the toning, works, but perhaps needs some tweaking.', '2005-11-30 06:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906840, 262287, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the angle, colors and simplicity.  Criticism; seems it needs a nudge rotation up on the right.  Perhaps a different colored background too, especially with the chosen ''front cover'' as it seems a bit ''washed out'' in my opinion.  The sharpest focus also seems to be on the wood, rather than the cds.</td>', '4 - Like the angle, colors and simplicity.  Criticism; seems it needs a nudge rotation up on the right.  Perhaps a different colored background too, especially with the chosen ''front cover'' as it seems a bit ''washed out'' in my opinion.  The sharpest focus also seems to be on the wood, rather than the cds.', '2005-11-30 06:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906841, 262454, 8140, '<td valign="top">nice colors 7</td>', 'nice colors 7', '2005-11-30 06:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906842, 263065, 8140, '<td valign="top">nice what to say 8</td>', 'nice what to say 8', '2005-11-30 06:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906844, 263552, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Criticism; not much, perhaps slightly sharper on some of the foremost shells, but may be difficult to get such good focus on all then so not sure.  Like the composition, symmetry, lines and shadows.  Maybe just a touch more color/contrast, if possible, but not sure on that.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Criticism; not much, perhaps slightly sharper on some of the foremost shells, but may be difficult to get such good focus on all then so not sure.  Like the composition, symmetry, lines and shadows.  Maybe just a touch more color/contrast, if possible, but not sure on that.', '2005-11-30 06:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906846, 262529, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Criticism; assuming these are all stamps and very small frames, makes this shot likely even more difficult to capture, but I think that more attention paid to focal points, composition and background detail, would have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Criticism; assuming these are all stamps and very small frames, makes this shot likely even more difficult to capture, but I think that more attention paid to focal points, composition and background detail, would have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 06:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906847, 263583, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice colors.  Criticism; slightly more ''fore focus'' would have made this better in my opinion, and a little sharper on whatever you choose to be in focus too.  Seems a blue light reflection on the green/khaki stone, but that may be in it so not sure.  The frame is too thick and detracts from this, especially at this size, in my opinion.  A different crop too, especially to incorporate or cut out that ''crystal''(?) on the right. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 07:53:30.</i></td>', '5 - Nice colors.  Criticism; slightly more ''fore focus'' would have made this better in my opinion, and a little sharper on whatever you choose to be in focus too.  Seems a blue light reflection on the green/khaki stone, but that may be in it so not sure.  The frame is too thick and detracts from this, especially at this size, in my opinion.  A different crop too, especially to incorporate or cut out that ''crystal''(?) on the right. edit:typo', '2005-11-30 06:41:08.000000', '2005-12-07 07:53:30.000000', 1),
(1906850, 262344, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - oops - wrong Challenge?  I give you 2 because there is a ''collection of pipes''.</td>', '2 - oops - wrong Challenge?  I give you 2 because there is a ''collection of pipes''.', '2005-11-30 06:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906851, 262383, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the concept and set up.  Criticism; perhaps a sharper angle, trying to create a more dramatic effect may have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps also placing the bamboo further in the background, may have created a better ''depth'' here too. edit:typo <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 07:49:52.</i></td>', '5 - Like the concept and set up.  Criticism; perhaps a sharper angle, trying to create a more dramatic effect may have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps also placing the bamboo further in the background, may have created a better ''depth'' here too. edit:typo ', '2005-11-30 06:43:53.000000', '2005-12-07 07:49:52.000000', 1),
(1906853, 263529, 8140, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2005-11-30 06:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906863, 262387, 42601, '<td valign="top">Very uninteresting shot...</td>', 'Very uninteresting shot...', '2005-11-30 07:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906864, 263699, 42601, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for me?</td>', 'A bit too dark for me?', '2005-11-30 07:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906866, 263175, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, nice DOF.<br/> <br/>The b/w lends a fantastic element to this pic, well done.</td>', 'Nice pic, nice DOF. The b/w lends a fantastic element to this pic, well done.', '2005-11-30 07:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
