(1906881, 261411, 42601, '<td valign="top">Okay, is there a reason there''''s a big dark shadow in the middle of the pic?<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>THis couldve been more impactful had you used a few candles and took a different angle I reckon...<br/> <br/>Sure, if you didnt have that luxury...</td>', 'Okay, is there a reason there''''s a big dark shadow in the middle of the pic? :) THis couldve been more impactful had you used a few candles and took a different angle I reckon... Sure, if you didnt have that luxury...', '2005-11-30 07:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906886, 263441, 44860, '<td valign="top">Cool. The only this I could mention is poor background...9</td>', 'Cool. The only this I could mention is poor background...9', '2005-11-30 07:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906888, 263699, 44860, '<td valign="top">Better background would make a difference...7</td>', 'Better background would make a difference...7', '2005-11-30 07:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906891, 263447, 44860, '<td valign="top">Original theme of collection. Definitely distracting black spots on yellow background. Harsh shadows does not add to the picture...6</td>', 'Original theme of collection. Definitely distracting black spots on yellow background. Harsh shadows does not add to the picture...6', '2005-11-30 07:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906894, 262537, 44860, '<td valign="top">Something''s wrong with preparing a photo for submission - horrible distracting artifacts of JPEG compression...4</td>', 'Something''s wrong with preparing a photo for submission - horrible distracting artifacts of JPEG compression...4', '2005-11-30 07:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906896, 262344, 41370, '<td valign="top">Did you put this in the wrong challeng?  Looks like it should have been in the Industrial challenge. I''ll give it some points as a collection of pipes.</td>', 'Did you put this in the wrong challeng?  Looks like it should have been in the Industrial challenge. I''ll give it some points as a collection of pipes.', '2005-11-30 07:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906900, 263150, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Mainly for your efforts and the potential.  Criticism; the lighting really is the main thing.  Possibly a sharper angle/perspective may have made this better in my opinion.  It''s a good idea, and while I am sure you had to have patience and couldn''t ''experiment'' too much, I just think there could have been some interesting ''potential'' shots given your ''subjects''.  Perhaps a more ''apt'' base, or ''different''; grass, fur, not sure, just something ''different''.</td>', '5 - Mainly for your efforts and the potential.  Criticism; the lighting really is the main thing.  Possibly a sharper angle/perspective may have made this better in my opinion.  It''s a good idea, and while I am sure you had to have patience and couldn''t ''experiment'' too much, I just think there could have been some interesting ''potential'' shots given your ''subjects''.  Perhaps a more ''apt'' base, or ''different''; grass, fur, not sure, just something ''different''.', '2005-11-30 07:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906904, 262303, 39850, '<td valign="top">Wrong Challenge? - can''t make any ''collections'' connection here, fingers, tools?, sorry - 1.  Ok 2, only because it is a good shot.  But is a ''DMC'' in my opinion.</td>', 'Wrong Challenge? - can''t make any ''collections'' connection here, fingers, tools?, sorry - 1.  Ok 2, only because it is a good shot.  But is a ''DMC'' in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 07:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906905, 262821, 41051, '<td valign="top">Great detail and colors.  Unbelievable array of stones.  I''ll bet they are from Egypt.</td>', 'Great detail and colors.  Unbelievable array of stones.  I''ll bet they are from Egypt.', '2005-11-30 07:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906909, 263182, 44601, '<td valign="top">Ok but off topic.</td>', 'Ok but off topic.', '2005-11-30 07:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906913, 263056, 44601, '<td valign="top">good idea, good collection. but over exposed and composition could be better. Suggest you do quarter face with focus on the eye at the bottom right might have more interesting effect.</td>', 'good idea, good collection. but over exposed and composition could be better. Suggest you do quarter face with focus on the eye at the bottom right might have more interesting effect.', '2005-11-30 07:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906914, 263285, 44601, '<td valign="top">Nice sillhoutes. Over exposed in the center. No link to topic.</td>', 'Nice sillhoutes. Over exposed in the center. No link to topic.', '2005-11-30 07:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906918, 263435, 47597, '<td valign="top">The bright light from the window really puts me off. The composition of the girl and the books is reall snapshottish, and uninspiring.</td>', 'The bright light from the window really puts me off. The composition of the girl and the books is reall snapshottish, and uninspiring.', '2005-11-30 07:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
