(1907757, 262303, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely stunning photo!!!   But I''m wondering if it was meant to go into the industrial challenge.   If you got it mixed up -- that is SUCH a shame!!!   I''ve done that before too -- but have always been lucky enough to catch it in time.     You know what?  I always vote with my heart, not entirely for technicalities or the rigid "meets the challenge" standards.   I like this picture so much, I''m giving it a 10, I don''t care if it should be in another challenge.   It is AWESOME and deserves recognition!   10<br/> <br/>P.S.  And I just voted in the Industrial challenge -- and I think this probably would have ribboned!</td>', 'This is an absolutely stunning photo!!!   But I''m wondering if it was meant to go into the industrial challenge.   If you got it mixed up -- that is SUCH a shame!!!   I''ve done that before too -- but have always been lucky enough to catch it in time.     You know what?  I always vote with my heart, not entirely for technicalities or the rigid "meets the challenge" standards.   I like this picture so much, I''m giving it a 10, I don''t care if it should be in another challenge.   It is AWESOME and deserves recognition!   10 P.S.  And I just voted in the Industrial challenge -- and I think this probably would have ribboned!', '2005-11-30 13:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
