(1908345, 262647, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice colour contrast but would have preferred a less tighter crop at the top.  If not, maybe a zoom in and tighter crop at the bottom to balance it.</td>', 'Nice colour contrast but would have preferred a less tighter crop at the top.  If not, maybe a zoom in and tighter crop at the bottom to balance it.', '2005-11-30 16:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
