(1908349, 261619, 45920, '<td valign="top">nice shot. hope you do well!</td>', 'nice shot. hope you do well!', '2005-11-30 16:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908352, 262303, 36557, '<td valign="top">Don''t see the "collection" here, except maybe this person has collected a lot of chocolate syrup on his hands.  Nice photo though.</td>', 'Don''t see the "collection" here, except maybe this person has collected a lot of chocolate syrup on his hands.  Nice photo though.', '2005-11-30 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908353, 261682, 42792, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus.</td>', 'Looks out of focus.', '2005-11-30 16:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908355, 262077, 45920, '<td valign="top">nice subject.  hope you do well!</td>', 'nice subject.  hope you do well!', '2005-11-30 16:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908357, 263450, 45920, '<td valign="top">nice shot. nice subject.</td>', 'nice shot. nice subject.', '2005-11-30 16:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908359, 263737, 36557, '<td valign="top">1st class Gunners Mate eh?  38...what ships hull number is that?</td>', '1st class Gunners Mate eh?  38...what ships hull number is that?', '2005-11-30 16:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908362, 263339, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Criticism; seems a few distracting marks in/on the background and not sure on the color choice, whether it complements the color of the ''Poohs''.  Perhaps if the focal point began a little more to the fore, or else a slightly tighter crop on the left, may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good.  Criticism; seems a few distracting marks in/on the background and not sure on the color choice, whether it complements the color of the ''Poohs''.  Perhaps if the focal point began a little more to the fore, or else a slightly tighter crop on the left, may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 16:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908363, 263720, 42792, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the harsh shadows are intentional but I would have preferred without.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the harsh shadows are intentional but I would have preferred without.', '2005-11-30 16:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908368, 263719, 42608, '<td valign="top">love the idea, but wish the lighting was a bit more interesting.</td>', 'love the idea, but wish the lighting was a bit more interesting.', '2005-11-30 16:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908370, 263699, 42608, '<td valign="top">self portarait?? nice idea.</td>', 'self portarait?? nice idea.', '2005-11-30 16:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908371, 262335, 42792, '<td valign="top">Not sure where collections come in here.</td>', 'Not sure where collections come in here.', '2005-11-30 16:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908374, 263770, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Mainly for the potential.  Colors are good and (from what I can discern) the focus &amp; focal point is good too.  Criticism; the size of this is the biggest negative.  Needs to be 640 on either width or height, in this case width.  I like the way you have set the middle unicorn facing up to the camera.  A slightly different crop (carefully choosing what to ''cut out''), and the size, would have made this much better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Mainly for the potential.  Colors are good and (from what I can discern) the focus & focal point is good too.  Criticism; the size of this is the biggest negative.  Needs to be 640 on either width or height, in this case width.  I like the way you have set the middle unicorn facing up to the camera.  A slightly different crop (carefully choosing what to ''cut out''), and the size, would have made this much better in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 16:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908375, 263435, 42792, '<td valign="top">The harsh glare from the windows are very distracting.</td>', 'The harsh glare from the windows are very distracting.', '2005-11-30 16:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908379, 263147, 42792, '<td valign="top">The blur on the larger turtles is very distracting. Otherwise could have been a pretty nice photo.</td>', 'The blur on the larger turtles is very distracting. Otherwise could have been a pretty nice photo.', '2005-11-30 16:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908395, 262303, 45737, '<td valign="top">I think you meant this for the Industrial challenge.</td>', 'I think you meant this for the Industrial challenge.', '2005-11-30 16:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908396, 263549, 42792, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2005-11-30 16:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908400, 263634, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good idea.  Criticism; obviously your call on display choice of charms, and while I think the play on words idea is good, still, I would like to have been able to see more detail in your ''charms''.  Whether you could do this in the set up you have (maybe with the spoon closer?) who knows.  The color of the bowl etc, and the lighting, do not enhance the shot, nor the charms, in my opinion.  Up to 6 from 5.</td>', '6 - Good idea.  Criticism; obviously your call on display choice of charms, and while I think the play on words idea is good, still, I would like to have been able to see more detail in your ''charms''.  Whether you could do this in the set up you have (maybe with the spoon closer?) who knows.  The color of the bowl etc, and the lighting, do not enhance the shot, nor the charms, in my opinion.  Up to 6 from 5.', '2005-11-30 16:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908409, 262303, 39349, '<td valign="top">This would be killing industrial, I''m wondering if that''s what you were going for? Beautiful and powerful image, amazing detail and I can find zero wrong with it technically. And even though I think it DNM(this)C, I''m still giving this a 10. Great job!</td>', 'This would be killing industrial, I''m wondering if that''s what you were going for? Beautiful and powerful image, amazing detail and I can find zero wrong with it technically. And even though I think it DNM(this)C, I''m still giving this a 10. Great job!', '2005-11-30 16:55:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1908411, 261530, 39349, '<td valign="top">WOW, now there''s some glass! Very well done!</td>', 'WOW, now there''s some glass! Very well done!', '2005-11-30 16:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908413, 263750, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the potential.  Criticism; assuming this is (or needed to be) a macro, the focus seems ''off''.  Like the colors, but perhaps adding more space between the feature and the backbround, may have given a bit more ''depth'' to this shot.  Possibly even a slightly different angle/perspective too (more side on?, not sure), and a crop/nudge rotation up on the left - to level the base, may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Like the potential.  Criticism; assuming this is (or needed to be) a macro, the focus seems ''off''.  Like the colors, but perhaps adding more space between the feature and the backbround, may have given a bit more ''depth'' to this shot.  Possibly even a slightly different angle/perspective too (more side on?, not sure), and a crop/nudge rotation up on the left - to level the base, may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 16:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908414, 262303, 42792, '<td valign="top">This image speaks volumes.  The texture and colour tones give it really rich detail.  Would have rated much higher if I wasn''t trying so hard to read into how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'This image speaks volumes.  The texture and colour tones give it really rich detail.  Would have rated much higher if I wasn''t trying so hard to read into how it meets the challenge.', '2005-11-30 16:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908415, 262845, 39349, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure about the Michael Bolton CD....... ;-)</td>', 'I''m not so sure about the Michael Bolton CD....... ;-)', '2005-11-30 16:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908424, 263485, 28029, '<td valign="top">Great title and reflective shot</td>', 'Great title and reflective shot', '2005-11-30 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908428, 262344, 42792, '<td valign="top">May have been better for the other challenge.</td>', 'May have been better for the other challenge.', '2005-11-30 16:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908430, 263432, 28029, '<td valign="top">I Love it!</td>', 'I Love it!', '2005-11-30 17:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908432, 262433, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good effort.  Criticism; not sure on the lighting, seems too much of a yellow or purple ''tinge'' to this, can''t discern which.  Slightly different composition, perhaps (no idea how) trying to get those skeletal hands more prominent, may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good effort.  Criticism; not sure on the lighting, seems too much of a yellow or purple ''tinge'' to this, can''t discern which.  Slightly different composition, perhaps (no idea how) trying to get those skeletal hands more prominent, may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 17:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908433, 263634, 28029, '<td valign="top">Clever</td>', 'Clever', '2005-11-30 17:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908436, 261758, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Criticism; like to see more context (zoomed out) and at least 640 on one side if not both.  Not sure on the b/w, works but needs some adjusting.  I wonder whether color, coupled with slightly more ''depth'' and a sharper angle/perspective, would have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Criticism; like to see more context (zoomed out) and at least 640 on one side if not both.  Not sure on the b/w, works but needs some adjusting.  I wonder whether color, coupled with slightly more ''depth'' and a sharper angle/perspective, would have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 17:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908440, 263714, 41411, '<td valign="top">I''ts kind of boring.</td>', 'I''ts kind of boring.', '2005-11-30 17:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908441, 262894, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like it.  Criticism; seems it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left, but difficult to tell.  Given the subject(s), I think a sharper focus on the front of the tractor would have made this better in my opinion.  The ''one'' with the eyes in the background slightly detracts from the overall ''feel'' in this shot also in my opinion - different ''style''. edit:typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 07:42:49.</i></td>', '6 - Like it.  Criticism; seems it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left, but difficult to tell.  Given the subject(s), I think a sharper focus on the front of the tractor would have made this better in my opinion.  The ''one'' with the eyes in the background slightly detracts from the overall ''feel'' in this shot also in my opinion - different ''style''. edit:typos', '2005-11-30 17:06:17.000000', '2005-12-07 07:42:49.000000', 1),
(1908448, 263643, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Nice colors.   Criticism; difficult to tell if it is just the painting on the figurines or not, but seems the focus is slightly off on the faces of the two in the fore, not sure.  Also, I want to say I''d like to see the flags also in focus, but this works too as is.  Maybe a slightly different ''composition''/cropping (mainly to get full length), not sure.</td>', '6 - Good.  Nice colors.   Criticism; difficult to tell if it is just the painting on the figurines or not, but seems the focus is slightly off on the faces of the two in the fore, not sure.  Also, I want to say I''d like to see the flags also in focus, but this works too as is.  Maybe a slightly different ''composition''/cropping (mainly to get full length), not sure.', '2005-11-30 17:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908450, 263485, 41411, '<td valign="top">This is hardly a rock collection... a bunch of flawless ricks and fenders and gibsons and prs''s... eye candy. the model does not look like much of a rocker. the setting does not imply rock at all. and those picks between the strings look kind of lame. plus... where''s the amp? got a gibson goldtone back there? some old fender tube amp? sorry, i''m a prick</td>', 'This is hardly a rock collection... a bunch of flawless ricks and fenders and gibsons and prs''s... eye candy. the model does not look like much of a rocker. the setting does not imply rock at all. and those picks between the strings look kind of lame. plus... where''s the amp? got a gibson goldtone back there? some old fender tube amp? sorry, i''m a prick', '2005-11-30 17:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908453, 263432, 42792, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  Just wished the lighting was better and a little more even.  The middle portion of the book heap looks like its in shadow.</td>', 'Love the idea.  Just wished the lighting was better and a little more even.  The middle portion of the book heap looks like its in shadow.', '2005-11-30 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908460, 263699, 41411, '<td valign="top">I like it. It looks like an album cover. I think it could use more contrast and less gray, but overall it''s good - 6</td>', 'I like it. It looks like an album cover. I think it could use more contrast and less gray, but overall it''s good - 6', '2005-11-30 17:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908462, 262490, 41411, '<td valign="top">I suppose this is a clever interpretation. The shot leaves something to be desired though... it is a bit dull/grainy/something - five</td>', 'I suppose this is a clever interpretation. The shot leaves something to be desired though... it is a bit dull/grainy/something - five', '2005-11-30 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908465, 263056, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - A lot of potential here.  Criticism; in my opinion, if you really wanted to include this lady in the shot, then she should be ''placed'' secondary to the dispensers.  The ''set up'' potential you have with all those dispensers, including their variety - is vast.  This just looks too ''snapshottish''.  The background and lighting also needs attention in my opinion.</td>', '3 - A lot of potential here.  Criticism; in my opinion, if you really wanted to include this lady in the shot, then she should be ''placed'' secondary to the dispensers.  The ''set up'' potential you have with all those dispensers, including their variety - is vast.  This just looks too ''snapshottish''.  The background and lighting also needs attention in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 17:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908467, 261923, 41411, '<td valign="top">your title is lame, but i like your choice of subject. it''s a bit grainy and that black in the top corner is somewhat misfortunate... 5</td>', 'your title is lame, but i like your choice of subject. it''s a bit grainy and that black in the top corner is somewhat misfortunate... 5', '2005-11-30 17:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908472, 263456, 41411, '<td valign="top">out of focus... four</td>', 'out of focus... four', '2005-11-30 17:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908473, 263447, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like the potential, especially with such an unusual ''collection''.  Criticism; background/base, lighting, arrangement and composition all need attention in my opinion.  I think the potential to arrange these so that their ''character'' dominates, as well as being mindful of complementing the colors placed next to each other, if you had achieved that, would have made this much better in my opinion. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 07:40:45.</i></td>', '3 - Like the potential, especially with such an unusual ''collection''.  Criticism; background/base, lighting, arrangement and composition all need attention in my opinion.  I think the potential to arrange these so that their ''character'' dominates, as well as being mindful of complementing the colors placed next to each other, if you had achieved that, would have made this much better in my opinion. edit:typo', '2005-11-30 17:18:18.000000', '2005-12-07 07:40:45.000000', 1),
(1908477, 263630, 47852, '<td valign="top">A unique selection of colors in this collection.  The surface that the bottles are sitting on is a bit distracting for me though.</td>', 'A unique selection of colors in this collection.  The surface that the bottles are sitting on is a bit distracting for me though.', '2005-11-30 17:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908478, 263323, 47205, '<td valign="top">The title for this reminds me of a line in a song by Dire Straits that says, "Two men say they''re Jesus, one of em must be wrong...."</td>', 'The title for this reminds me of a line in a song by Dire Straits that says, "Two men say they''re Jesus, one of em must be wrong...."', '2005-11-30 17:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908481, 263476, 47852, '<td valign="top">Is that lightning in the background?  Incredible!</td>', 'Is that lightning in the background?  Incredible!', '2005-11-30 17:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908484, 262430, 47205, '<td valign="top">I think I saw these for sale at Hallmark the other day...cute</td>', 'I think I saw these for sale at Hallmark the other day...cute', '2005-11-30 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908485, 262054, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute collection.  The light seems too bright, washing out some of the details on the figures.</td>', 'Cute collection.  The light seems too bright, washing out some of the details on the figures.', '2005-11-30 17:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908486, 262845, 41411, '<td valign="top">i''m judging you based on your choice in music...</td>', 'i''m judging you based on your choice in music...', '2005-11-30 17:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908488, 262955, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very good idea, well done if it is original.  Criticism; you haven''t quite achieved the full potential in this shot in my opinion.  Whether it is the focus, angle, lighting, not sure.  Perhaps using up 640 in both directions and gaining more symmetry may also have helped this.  Not sure on the framing, it detracts in my opinion. edit:typo <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 06:31:43.</i></td>', '6 - Very good idea, well done if it is original.  Criticism; you haven''t quite achieved the full potential in this shot in my opinion.  Whether it is the focus, angle, lighting, not sure.  Perhaps using up 640 in both directions and gaining more symmetry may also have helped this.  Not sure on the framing, it detracts in my opinion. edit:typo ', '2005-11-30 17:23:35.000000', '2005-12-07 06:31:43.000000', 1),
(1908491, 262387, 47852, '<td valign="top">A great idea for a collection, and it looks well used... the picture is a little boring though.  Perhaps taking it from more of a front angle and sticking a few of them up out of the box to let us see what yummy foods you''re making?</td>', 'A great idea for a collection, and it looks well used... the picture is a little boring though.  Perhaps taking it from more of a front angle and sticking a few of them up out of the box to let us see what yummy foods you''re making?', '2005-11-30 17:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908498, 263432, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Criticism; perhaps even a sharper angle and slightly better focus/detail in the books/foreground, may have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '7 - Good.  Criticism; perhaps even a sharper angle and slightly better focus/detail in the books/foreground, may have made this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-11-30 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908502, 262828, 47852, '<td valign="top">I love the way the faces seem to be looking at and interacting with the viewer!</td>', 'I love the way the faces seem to be looking at and interacting with the viewer!', '2005-11-30 17:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908507, 261940, 47852, '<td valign="top">A bit too bright... some of the toys are hard to see.</td>', 'A bit too bright... some of the toys are hard to see.', '2005-11-30 17:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908508, 262814, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this picture... reminds me of grandmas good china.  A bit too bright on the left side.</td>', 'I like the feel of this picture... reminds me of grandmas good china.  A bit too bright on the left side.', '2005-11-30 17:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908514, 263439, 47852, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit too cluttered for me between the items on the top shelf, the reflections, and the items underneath.</td>', 'This image is a bit too cluttered for me between the items on the top shelf, the reflections, and the items underneath.', '2005-11-30 17:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908515, 263284, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very nice colors and composition and angle/perspective.  Criticism; difficult, as this is a bit of a stretch for ''collections'' in the spirit of the Challenge (and has restricted my score).  Near perfect symmetry as far as I can discern, maybe a couple are ''off'', but fairly minor.  This shot may lend itself well to an abstract too if the focus were adjusted, but moot point.</td>', '6 - Very nice colors and composition and angle/perspective.  Criticism; difficult, as this is a bit of a stretch for ''collections'' in the spirit of the Challenge (and has restricted my score).  Near perfect symmetry as far as I can discern, maybe a couple are ''off'', but fairly minor.  This shot may lend itself well to an abstract too if the focus were adjusted, but moot point.', '2005-11-30 17:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908517, 263614, 47852, '<td valign="top">Just using a few state quarters that aren''t in very good shape doesn''t stand out as being very memorable to me.  Perhaps if they were in better condition, or you had a bigger collection of them, it could be a higher rated photo.</td>', 'Just using a few state quarters that aren''t in very good shape doesn''t stand out as being very memorable to me.  Perhaps if they were in better condition, or you had a bigger collection of them, it could be a higher rated photo.', '2005-11-30 17:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908520, 262845, 47852, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing what tilting something so common can do for the compostion of a picture.  I like the feel of it.</td>', 'It''s amazing what tilting something so common can do for the compostion of a picture.  I like the feel of it.', '2005-11-30 17:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908523, 263396, 28029, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I would have had a poker light directly over the table.</td>', 'Great shot but I would have had a poker light directly over the table.', '2005-11-30 17:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908526, 263130, 47852, '<td valign="top">I expected to see lots of coins and state quarters in this challenge, but using the new nickels is just different enough!  I like the way you set up this shot!</td>', 'I expected to see lots of coins and state quarters in this challenge, but using the new nickels is just different enough!  I like the way you set up this shot!', '2005-11-30 17:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908528, 262344, 28029, '<td valign="top">Oops wrong challenge!</td>', 'Oops wrong challenge!', '2005-11-30 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908530, 262383, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the bamboo background for this shot.  Makes it hard to figure out how big the figurines are though.</td>', 'I like the bamboo background for this shot.  Makes it hard to figure out how big the figurines are though.', '2005-11-30 17:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908533, 263460, 47852, '<td valign="top">The quality of the shot is poor and grainy... I can''t tell what a few of the items are.  I also would have cropped the white along the right and bottom out before submitting this photo.</td>', 'The quality of the shot is poor and grainy... I can''t tell what a few of the items are.  I also would have cropped the white along the right and bottom out before submitting this photo.', '2005-11-30 17:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908534, 263452, 47852, '<td valign="top">Hope to see more of this collection in coming challenges!  Very cute.. love the detail of the fur and the peaceful, relaxed expression that you captured.</td>', 'Hope to see more of this collection in coming challenges!  Very cute.. love the detail of the fur and the peaceful, relaxed expression that you captured.', '2005-11-30 17:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908535, 263723, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Criticism; difficult, as this is fairly well flawless, save for perhaps the odd green at the top, but minor. But in my opinion, this shot / set-up needs something to ''lift it'', not sure what, nor how.  Whether a horizontal crop instead, or a 640 x 640, or a different colored ''base'' (even though it is kind of ''road like''), or unusual lighting, not sure.  Maybe a frame in this instance would have helped, no idea.</td>', '7 - Good.  Criticism; difficult, as this is fairly well flawless, save for perhaps the odd green at the top, but minor. But in my opinion, this shot / set-up needs something to ''lift it'', not sure what, nor how.  Whether a horizontal crop instead, or a 640 x 640, or a different colored ''base'' (even though it is kind of ''road like''), or unusual lighting, not sure.  Maybe a frame in this instance would have helped, no idea.', '2005-11-30 17:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908537, 262500, 47852, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what these are for, but they look cool and make a great photo!  Well done!</td>', 'I have no idea what these are for, but they look cool and make a great photo!  Well done!', '2005-11-30 17:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908541, 262923, 47852, '<td valign="top">Something seems off with this photo... dirty fingers, clean rocks, and a pink checked dress.</td>', 'Something seems off with this photo... dirty fingers, clean rocks, and a pink checked dress.', '2005-11-30 17:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908546, 261475, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the clean and simple look of this photo!  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Love the clean and simple look of this photo!  Very nicely done.', '2005-11-30 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
