(1911615, 263495, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and composition. Its simple yet powerful. Good use of space.</td>', 'Very nice color and composition. Its simple yet powerful. Good use of space.', '2005-12-01 08:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911620, 263263, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the green ones, the glass piece on the left is a bit distracting but the reflections at the top is fantastic. It really makes it look like more elephants.</td>', 'Very nice, love the green ones, the glass piece on the left is a bit distracting but the reflections at the top is fantastic. It really makes it look like more elephants.', '2005-12-01 08:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911621, 263140, 19978, '<td valign="top">This picture has wonderful potential, but suffers from some problems that will hurt its scoring in this challenge. It looks like you were shooting in fairly dim light, and your camera used a longer shutter speed to compensate. At that speed, it was unavoidable that your hand moved a bit while the shutter was open, blurring the spoons considerably. It''s a shame not to be able to make out the detail present at the ends of the handles, for that surely would have been a great point of interest in your photo. Brace the camera on a steady object or use a tripod when shooting in dim light to avoid that motion blur. You can also bring in some brighter lights, shining them from the side to avoid the glare and reflection that would come from lights above or behind you. Keep shooting and entering challenges!</td>', 'This picture has wonderful potential, but suffers from some problems that will hurt its scoring in this challenge. It looks like you were shooting in fairly dim light, and your camera used a longer shutter speed to compensate. At that speed, it was unavoidable that your hand moved a bit while the shutter was open, blurring the spoons considerably. It''s a shame not to be able to make out the detail present at the ends of the handles, for that surely would have been a great point of interest in your photo. Brace the camera on a steady object or use a tripod when shooting in dim light to avoid that motion blur. You can also bring in some brighter lights, shining them from the side to avoid the glare and reflection that would come from lights above or behind you. Keep shooting and entering challenges!', '2005-12-01 08:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911623, 263749, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice display, love the colors and the wood grain in the back really adds to the feel of this picture.</td>', 'Nice display, love the colors and the wood grain in the back really adds to the feel of this picture.', '2005-12-01 08:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911629, 263589, 19978, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept! I''d also like to see a much tighter crop - maybe the barrel, trigger area of the gun and a few fragments of playing cards and bills. Really fill the frame with that pistol - great impact!</td>', 'Brilliant concept! I''d also like to see a much tighter crop - maybe the barrel, trigger area of the gun and a few fragments of playing cards and bills. Really fill the frame with that pistol - great impact!', '2005-12-01 08:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911661, 263485, 19978, '<td valign="top">This shot is soooo much more effective because of your decision to include a person. Bravo. To improve it even more, I''d have tightened the composition around the person, esp the hands and guitar he''s holding, with the other guitars visible around and behind him. The open doors, stretch of carpet, and window do not add to the overall impact. Good shot and WONDERFUL collection of guitars. Kudos.</td>', 'This shot is soooo much more effective because of your decision to include a person. Bravo. To improve it even more, I''d have tightened the composition around the person, esp the hands and guitar he''s holding, with the other guitars visible around and behind him. The open doors, stretch of carpet, and window do not add to the overall impact. Good shot and WONDERFUL collection of guitars. Kudos.', '2005-12-01 08:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911683, 263339, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, nice angle, nice light!</td>', 'Nice shot, nice angle, nice light!', '2005-12-01 09:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
