(1911750, 263084, 19841, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing a lot of photos like this.  A nice collection, carefully arranged, and the photo taken with the flash attached to the camera.  The flat lighting just kills everything.  You have a good eye, and your technique is otherwise good. Try disabling the flash on your camera, and keep shooting!</td>', 'I''m seeing a lot of photos like this.  A nice collection, carefully arranged, and the photo taken with the flash attached to the camera.  The flat lighting just kills everything.  You have a good eye, and your technique is otherwise good. Try disabling the flash on your camera, and keep shooting!', '2005-12-01 09:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
