(1911993, 263649, 26364, '<td valign="top">Wow! Awesome collection. I love stuff from the 1950''s and I was born in the early 70''s.</td>', 'Wow! Awesome collection. I love stuff from the 1950''s and I was born in the early 70''s.', '2005-12-01 10:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912005, 263756, 16950, '<td valign="top">Very creative way of sharing your collection.  Image seems a tad too soft.</td>', 'Very creative way of sharing your collection.  Image seems a tad too soft.', '2005-12-01 10:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912009, 262955, 26364, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept. Good job. Creative.</td>', 'Excellent concept. Good job. Creative.', '2005-12-01 10:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912012, 262387, 16950, '<td valign="top">A little plain.  Maybe a different angle or composition so we could see some of the recepies?  I would never have guessed what they were without the title.</td>', 'A little plain.  Maybe a different angle or composition so we could see some of the recepies?  I would never have guessed what they were without the title.', '2005-12-01 10:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912022, 263601, 16950, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo, but you will get lots of comments on the size.  Too small to really get a feel for your subject.</td>', 'I really like the photo, but you will get lots of comments on the size.  Too small to really get a feel for your subject.', '2005-12-01 10:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912030, 263707, 16950, '<td valign="top">A little cluttered.  I also think it I would like it better if the focus was on the front tank with the DOF gradually fading towards the back.</td>', 'A little cluttered.  I also think it I would like it better if the focus was on the front tank with the DOF gradually fading towards the back.', '2005-12-01 10:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912059, 262925, 16950, '<td valign="top">Collections?</td>', 'Collections?', '2005-12-01 10:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912060, 262959, 40484, '<td valign="top">good composition of ornaments. You may want to consider ironing your backdrop cloth next time so that the creases don''t distract from the subject (expecially when they run between the articles) IMHO</td>', 'good composition of ornaments. You may want to consider ironing your backdrop cloth next time so that the creases don''t distract from the subject (expecially when they run between the articles) IMHO', '2005-12-01 10:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912080, 263456, 16950, '<td valign="top">Great shot and collection.  Could use a little sharper focus.</td>', 'Great shot and collection.  Could use a little sharper focus.', '2005-12-01 10:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912125, 263220, 26773, '<td valign="top">I hope you work at a liqour store, cause that looks expensive!</td>', 'I hope you work at a liqour store, cause that looks expensive!', '2005-12-01 11:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912145, 263649, 28029, '<td valign="top">Love the collection but the picture is sub-par, The bright light is distracting and conflicts with the dark background. What is the dark black thing in the foreground? The tilt adds interest but at what cost? A straight shot may have enabled you to crop the dark splotch in the foreground and perhaps not cut the White rose sign at the top. 6</td>', 'Love the collection but the picture is sub-par, The bright light is distracting and conflicts with the dark background. What is the dark black thing in the foreground? The tilt adds interest but at what cost? A straight shot may have enabled you to crop the dark splotch in the foreground and perhaps not cut the White rose sign at the top. 6', '2005-12-01 11:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912154, 263285, 16950, '<td valign="top">Where is the collection?</td>', 'Where is the collection?', '2005-12-01 11:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912166, 262335, 16950, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see a collection here...</td>', 'Not sure I see a collection here...', '2005-12-01 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912171, 261671, 16950, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but stretching ''collections'' a bit.</td>', 'Cool shot, but stretching ''collections'' a bit.', '2005-12-01 11:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912208, 262433, 16950, '<td valign="top">I really like the subtle ghostly skeleton hands.  I almost missed them at first, but definitely adds to your submission.  Showing some of the cover art may have made this better.</td>', 'I really like the subtle ghostly skeleton hands.  I almost missed them at first, but definitely adds to your submission.  Showing some of the cover art may have made this better.', '2005-12-01 11:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
