(1912225, 263770, 16950, '<td valign="top">You''ll hear this many times I am sure... too small.  Looks like a good picture otherwise.</td>', 'You''ll hear this many times I am sure... too small.  Looks like a good picture otherwise.', '2005-12-01 11:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912228, 262894, 28276, '<td valign="top">my son turns two this monday...  his birthday cake will be a sheet cake that looks like a field being plowed by little diecast john deer tractors...  if it turns out cute, i''ll have to remember to post a photo of it.<br/> <br/>as for the photo, i like the angle you chose, though i think i''d have shifted just a little left.  the depth of field should have been a little longer, though.  having the front of the first tractor out of focus is a bit distracting.</td>', 'my son turns two this monday...  his birthday cake will be a sheet cake that looks like a field being plowed by little diecast john deer tractors...  if it turns out cute, i''ll have to remember to post a photo of it. as for the photo, i like the angle you chose, though i think i''d have shifted just a little left.  the depth of field should have been a little longer, though.  having the front of the first tractor out of focus is a bit distracting.', '2005-12-01 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1912230, 263583, 26542, '<td valign="top">What a fantasmagoric collection of stones!</td>', 'What a fantasmagoric collection of stones!', '2005-12-01 11:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
