(1914702, 263045, 41450, '<td valign="top">nece execution and lens choice.  I think a darker or more textrued surface would have made this look more dramatic and not pulled your eyes down so much</td>', 'nece execution and lens choice.  I think a darker or more textrued surface would have made this look more dramatic and not pulled your eyes down so much', '2005-12-01 23:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
