(1917719, 263459, 29326, '<td valign="top">Seems a little blurred to me.  I think it could be stronger by reducing the number of elements -- heads.</td>', 'Seems a little blurred to me.  I think it could be stronger by reducing the number of elements -- heads.', '2005-12-02 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917735, 261214, 29326, '<td valign="top">Could have used this for camouflage.  Took me a few seconds to find all the people.</td>', 'Could have used this for camouflage.  Took me a few seconds to find all the people.', '2005-12-02 22:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917739, 263495, 29326, '<td valign="top">I like the dramtic lighting and placement within the frame.</td>', 'I like the dramtic lighting and placement within the frame.', '2005-12-02 22:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917755, 263529, 45596, '<td valign="top">I like the humor!</td>', 'I like the humor!', '2005-12-02 22:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917760, 263454, 45596, '<td valign="top">The bluish tone color is somwhat distracting to me.</td>', 'The bluish tone color is somwhat distracting to me.', '2005-12-02 22:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917763, 261520, 29326, '<td valign="top">Great title, wish I had though of it.  The backlighting isn''t a big plus for me.  It seems to obscure the tickets so they can''t be read without a positive benefit.  I''m not sure what you were aiming for.  Maybe an x-ray effect?</td>', 'Great title, wish I had though of it.  The backlighting isn''t a big plus for me.  It seems to obscure the tickets so they can''t be read without a positive benefit.  I''m not sure what you were aiming for.  Maybe an x-ray effect?', '2005-12-02 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917774, 263346, 29326, '<td valign="top">So now we all know where the "other" sock is.</td>', 'So now we all know where the "other" sock is.', '2005-12-02 22:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917777, 262335, 45596, '<td valign="top">Interesting pic...I like the experimentation that takes away the snap shot effect..the use of grain, tilting, smaller size..etc.  I wish it had more of a "collection" feel to it such as using multiple kittens instead of one.</td>', 'Interesting pic...I like the experimentation that takes away the snap shot effect..the use of grain, tilting, smaller size..etc.  I wish it had more of a "collection" feel to it such as using multiple kittens instead of one.', '2005-12-02 22:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917787, 263217, 45596, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you were trying to achieve by cropping out the claws on the left and right side of the pic.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you were trying to achieve by cropping out the claws on the left and right side of the pic.', '2005-12-02 22:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917795, 263521, 29326, '<td valign="top">Great subject and fitting title.</td>', 'Great subject and fitting title.', '2005-12-02 22:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917814, 263040, 45596, '<td valign="top">Very cool pic...I know its a model, but I love the spot light and the drape over the car.  It makes the model appear larger than it is.  For the collection theme, I wonder if you could have achieved the same effect by using more than one car.</td>', 'Very cool pic...I know its a model, but I love the spot light and the drape over the car.  It makes the model appear larger than it is.  For the collection theme, I wonder if you could have achieved the same effect by using more than one car.', '2005-12-02 22:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917815, 263750, 29326, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Maybe a little less light on the background (or more accent light on the foreground) would make it easier to "read" .</td>', 'Very nice.  Maybe a little less light on the background (or more accent light on the foreground) would make it easier to "read" .', '2005-12-02 22:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917838, 263435, 45596, '<td valign="top">Yes there are a lot of books.  Sorta looks like the subject is in a library rather than a book collector.  The lights from the window is distracting.  Perhaps a different angle would have been better.</td>', 'Yes there are a lot of books.  Sorta looks like the subject is in a library rather than a book collector.  The lights from the window is distracting.  Perhaps a different angle would have been better.', '2005-12-02 22:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917849, 263527, 45596, '<td valign="top">Appears too much like a snap shot.  Perhaps using a different angle or lighting could have made the pic more dramatice and interesting.</td>', 'Appears too much like a snap shot.  Perhaps using a different angle or lighting could have made the pic more dramatice and interesting.', '2005-12-02 22:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917883, 263247, 43037, '<td valign="top">thats a really cool picture<br/></td>', 'thats a really cool picture', '2005-12-02 22:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917890, 263521, 45596, '<td valign="top">I like the humor.  I''m willing to bet most comments will complain about the date stamp being distracting.</td>', 'I like the humor.  I''m willing to bet most comments will complain about the date stamp being distracting.', '2005-12-02 23:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917905, 263708, 45596, '<td valign="top">Extremely interesting.  Nice job...8</td>', 'Extremely interesting.  Nice job...8', '2005-12-02 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917910, 263634, 45596, '<td valign="top">Looks magically delicious  :-)<br/>I appreciate the humor.  Nice job!</td>', 'Looks magically delicious  :-)I appreciate the humor.  Nice job!', '2005-12-02 23:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917925, 263763, 45596, '<td valign="top">It fits the season and the theme.  Not so sure about originality.  Technically, its a good pic.</td>', 'It fits the season and the theme.  Not so sure about originality.  Technically, its a good pic.', '2005-12-02 23:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917932, 263285, 45596, '<td valign="top">I think you totally missed the theme with this pic.</td>', 'I think you totally missed the theme with this pic.', '2005-12-02 23:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1917951, 262387, 45596, '<td valign="top">Recepies?  This could be a collection of any subject matter.  Basically it''s an uninteresting pic....sorry.  Perphaps if the light came from a different angle and the pic was in black and white.</td>', 'Recepies?  This could be a collection of any subject matter.  Basically it''s an uninteresting pic....sorry.  Perphaps if the light came from a different angle and the pic was in black and white.', '2005-12-02 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
