(1918438, 263456, 47971, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you intended this shot to be blurry, but it is distracting. You probably did not want the BG around the fridge to be in the shot, but you should not have cropped the outside magnets out of the shot. Maybe you could have pushed the together a bit more allowing the composition to be cleaner.</td>', 'Not sure if you intended this shot to be blurry, but it is distracting. You probably did not want the BG around the fridge to be in the shot, but you should not have cropped the outside magnets out of the shot. Maybe you could have pushed the together a bit more allowing the composition to be cleaner.', '2005-12-03 04:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918442, 263140, 48545, '<td valign="top">really doesn''t work for me,  lacking composition and the blur doesn''t add to an ''old effect'' at all.  I''d be interested to see if I''m missing something here.</td>', 'really doesn''t work for me,  lacking composition and the blur doesn''t add to an ''old effect'' at all.  I''d be interested to see if I''m missing something here.', '2005-12-03 04:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918444, 262502, 47971, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Just I feel the compositon should be a little wider allowing the propeller of the burgundy plane into the shot :)</td>', 'Nice shot. Just I feel the compositon should be a little wider allowing the propeller of the burgundy plane into the shot :)', '2005-12-03 04:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918448, 262537, 48545, '<td valign="top">Looks like the JPEG compression has caused the artifacts on the edging.....</td>', 'Looks like the JPEG compression has caused the artifacts on the edging.....', '2005-12-03 04:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918450, 262955, 48545, '<td valign="top">great photo, made me chuckle.  Shame one of the daddy-long-legs legs has been left behind !!!!!  the price you pay for escaping!</td>', 'great photo, made me chuckle.  Shame one of the daddy-long-legs legs has been left behind !!!!!  the price you pay for escaping!', '2005-12-03 04:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918454, 263459, 47971, '<td valign="top">You should use a tripod or prop the camera on something solid so the camera remains still while the shutter is open (unless the blur is intentional). But in this sort of shot the blur is distracting.</td>', 'You should use a tripod or prop the camera on something solid so the camera remains still while the shutter is open (unless the blur is intentional). But in this sort of shot the blur is distracting.', '2005-12-03 04:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918455, 263614, 47971, '<td valign="top">Shame that the top coin is cropped out of composition.</td>', 'Shame that the top coin is cropped out of composition.', '2005-12-03 04:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918458, 263652, 47971, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of my boyhood, great shot.</td>', 'This reminds me of my boyhood, great shot.', '2005-12-03 05:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918464, 263757, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice idea, think if you had taken them at an angle, not so flat in other words,may have worked better, thinking out aloud. :)  7</td>', 'nice idea, think if you had taken them at an angle, not so flat in other words,may have worked better, thinking out aloud. :)  7', '2005-12-03 05:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918467, 263140, 47971, '<td valign="top">Ummm this shot needs some critic, only so you improve your skill and stop subjecting us to this sort of photography. USE A TRIPOD, or at least a stack of books or anything solid that lets your camera remain stationary as you press the shutter. Also the composition is poor. In this sort of straight forward depicting shot, every spoon should be completly in the shot. Lastly spend a little more time lighting your shot. Epecially when the colours are so drab, you need lighting to destinguish them giving your shot more definition. The only merit points I give you is for having the courage to enter this shot :)</td>', 'Ummm this shot needs some critic, only so you improve your skill and stop subjecting us to this sort of photography. USE A TRIPOD, or at least a stack of books or anything solid that lets your camera remain stationary as you press the shutter. Also the composition is poor. In this sort of straight forward depicting shot, every spoon should be completly in the shot. Lastly spend a little more time lighting your shot. Epecially when the colours are so drab, you need lighting to destinguish them giving your shot more definition. The only merit points I give you is for having the courage to enter this shot :)', '2005-12-03 05:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918472, 263717, 47971, '<td valign="top">Artistically an interesting photograph. Unfortunately you probably will be ill percieved (post processing) for this shot. But art has no rules...</td>', 'Artistically an interesting photograph. Unfortunately you probably will be ill percieved (post processing) for this shot. But art has no rules...', '2005-12-03 05:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1918476, 263733, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2005-12-03 05:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
