(1918955, 263056, 31628, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of unrealized potential here.  I am imagining all these pez standing up on a monochormatic background.  Either they are all facing the same way, lined up in a grid, or they are grouped into cliques seemingly chatting.  The wood pattern is distracting here as is the flash.</td>', 'There is a lot of unrealized potential here.  I am imagining all these pez standing up on a monochormatic background.  Either they are all facing the same way, lined up in a grid, or they are grouped into cliques seemingly chatting.  The wood pattern is distracting here as is the flash.', '2005-12-03 12:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
