(1921238, 262303, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you meant to enter this to industrial and are kicking yourself right now (and probably getting lots of comments about this being in the wrong challenge).  Just wanted to tell you though how stunning an image you have created here.  The detail, texture, contrast is just amazing.  Well done!</td>', 'I''m assuming you meant to enter this to industrial and are kicking yourself right now (and probably getting lots of comments about this being in the wrong challenge).  Just wanted to tell you though how stunning an image you have created here.  The detail, texture, contrast is just amazing.  Well done!', '2005-12-04 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
