(1921295, 263435, 5885, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but execution could be tuned. <br/> <br/>Things to work on: The Window lighting is distracting. Change angle so that the window light comes from your back or from off to a side. <br/> <br/>This would also eliminate the shadows from the flash, whcih make this a snapshot quality photo.<br/> <br/>Try to use the rule of thirds in your photos. The subject, in this case the girl would have been stronger if she had been moved to the very left of the composition with books filling the rest of the frame.</td>', 'Good idea, but execution could be tuned.  Things to work on: The Window lighting is distracting. Change angle so that the window light comes from your back or from off to a side.  This would also eliminate the shadows from the flash, whcih make this a snapshot quality photo. Try to use the rule of thirds in your photos. The subject, in this case the girl would have been stronger if she had been moved to the very left of the composition with books filling the rest of the frame.', '2005-12-04 15:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
