(1929728, 263181, 40718, '<td valign="top">Congrats Angela, not bad for so few challenges.  Didn''t I scold you in a thread about leaving NA in your comment section?  Now that you are a "ribbon winner" you need to share... ;)</td>', 'Congrats Angela, not bad for so few challenges.  Didn''t I scold you in a thread about leaving NA in your comment section?  Now that you are a "ribbon winner" you need to share... ;)', '2005-12-07 00:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
