(1929744, 263284, 22734, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. Manny you sure know how to romance the eyes. An image from a different realm but what a fan of colors. Congratulations on your BLUE!</td>', 'Fabulous. Manny you sure know how to romance the eyes. An image from a different realm but what a fan of colors. Congratulations on your BLUE!', '2005-12-07 00:25:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929752, 263181, 22734, '<td valign="top">Angela: i am jumping for joy on your behalf. This is such a fantastic study which got my highest vote. Into my favs at once. Congratulations on your RED.</td>', 'Angela: i am jumping for joy on your behalf. This is such a fantastic study which got my highest vote. Into my favs at once. Congratulations on your RED.', '2005-12-07 00:27:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929754, 263284, 42492, '<td valign="top">congrats on your blue. Great photo and very colorful indeed</td>', 'congrats on your blue. Great photo and very colorful indeed', '2005-12-07 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929761, 263552, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Yellow with this arrow of shells whose lighting and composition leave nothing else to be desired. A bullseye! Congratulations on your Yellow.</td>', 'Congratulations on your Yellow with this arrow of shells whose lighting and composition leave nothing else to be desired. A bullseye! Congratulations on your Yellow.', '2005-12-07 00:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929762, 263181, 42492, '<td valign="top">congrats on your ribbon. Great photo</td>', 'congrats on your ribbon. Great photo', '2005-12-07 00:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929763, 263181, 42826, '<td valign="top">Ok, I never add my own comments.  But since I finally got a ribbon I think I should.<br/> <br/>My DPC friends helped me finalize my shot...I got their opinions and I used them...it obviously did me some good!  <br/> <br/>Dance is one of my all time favorite thing to do...it was Sunday and I still didn''t have anything to do for either challenge.  Then I thought I have tons of costumes and lots of pointe shoes...how can I make that into something interesting.  So i found an old costume that suprisingly still fit, put it on and asked some opinions on how to make it interesting....used every idea that came to my mind and the minds of others and shot them.  Looked at all of them on the computer, did basic editting and asked all my IM friends which shot they liked best...most of them chose this one...<br/> <br/>Thanks ya''ll</td>', 'Ok, I never add my own comments.  But since I finally got a ribbon I think I should. My DPC friends helped me finalize my shot...I got their opinions and I used them...it obviously did me some good!   Dance is one of my all time favorite thing to do...it was Sunday and I still didn''t have anything to do for either challenge.  Then I thought I have tons of costumes and lots of pointe shoes...how can I make that into something interesting.  So i found an old costume that suprisingly still fit, put it on and asked some opinions on how to make it interesting....used every idea that came to my mind and the minds of others and shot them.  Looked at all of them on the computer, did basic editting and asked all my IM friends which shot they liked best...most of them chose this one... Thanks ya''ll', '2005-12-07 00:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929768, 263552, 42492, '<td valign="top">congrats on your ribbon. Great photo</td>', 'congrats on your ribbon. Great photo', '2005-12-07 00:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929777, 263284, 15711, '<td valign="top">God, Mannie! You can make anything look beautiful! Congrats.</td>', 'God, Mannie! You can make anything look beautiful! Congrats.', '2005-12-07 00:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
