(1930388, 263181, 19744, '<td valign="top">Dear Angela, wonderful shot, gave it a 10. The model is great, the link for "collection" is so well chosen by all the shoes. Composition is perfect according to the rules of thirds. What I''m not sure about is: The light spot in the center background. Maybe another background lightning would have enhanced the attention on the collection even more. Well done. Yours, Jan<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 03:42:06.</i></td>', 'Dear Angela, wonderful shot, gave it a 10. The model is great, the link for "collection" is so well chosen by all the shoes. Composition is perfect according to the rules of thirds. What I''m not sure about is: The light spot in the center background. Maybe another background lightning would have enhanced the attention on the collection even more. Well done. Yours, Jan', '2005-12-07 03:41:38.000000', '2005-12-07 03:42:06.000000', 0),
