(1946706, 263284, 39705, '<td valign="top">again?! :) but then not again as this takes you away from your usual colorful subjects. but the point still well made.  a simple tilt, a simple pattern and voila! again you make us pinoy proud.</td>', 'again?! :) but then not again as this takes you away from your usual colorful subjects. but the point still well made.  a simple tilt, a simple pattern and voila! again you make us pinoy proud.', '2005-12-13 09:52:08.000000', NULL, 0);
