(1963227, 263271, 6804, '<td valign="top">I can not believe this one finished at only a 5.194.  It is awesome!!<br/>I think if you asked the voters, without being able to look back at the entries, which pictures do they remember most from the collections challenge.  I think most would agree this is one that stands out.  Kudos on ya!! <br/>(It''s still a 10 in my book, the others just haven''t figured it out yet.)   <br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'I can not believe this one finished at only a 5.194.  It is awesome!!I think if you asked the voters, without being able to look back at the entries, which pictures do they remember most from the collections challenge.  I think most would agree this is one that stands out.  Kudos on ya!! (It''s still a 10 in my book, the others just haven''t figured it out yet.)    :)', '2005-12-19 17:02:32.000000', NULL, 0),
